  "prefLabel": "Tax 201.28 Electronic Proceedings",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Tax 201.28 Electronic Proceedings.\n\n(a) On its own or upon motion or request, the board may hold any proceeding using telephonic or other electronic means.\n\n(b) The board shall record all such proceedings held under (a) above.\n\nSource. #5638, eff 9-1-93; ss by #7068, INTERIM, eff 8-15-99, EXPIRES, 12-13-99; ss by #7153, eff 12-10-99; ss by #8986, eff 9-24-07; ss by #10624, eff 6-26-14; ss by #13687, eff 7-19-23",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/tax100-500.html"
